    "id": 33,
    "startupName": "DC App ( digital chhattisgarh shopping)",
    "district": "Dantewada",
    "founderName": "Anurag gupta",
    "age": "22",
    "address": "saroj house no 346 ward 08 main market kirandul",
    "education": "graduation",
    "mobile": "8518040381",
    "email": "anuragg667@gmail.com",
    "description": "Startup Name: Digital Chhattisgarh\n\nStartup Description:\n\nDigital Chhattisgarh is a hyperlocal service-based mobile application designed to revolutionize online shopping in underserved regions, starting with Kirandul, Bacheli, and Dantewada. These areas currently lack structured e-commerce and doorstep delivery solutions, despite increasing interest in online shopping.\n\nOur app aims to bridge this gap by offering door-to-door delivery of essential products such as:\n\nFresh vegetables and fruits\n\nGroceries and daily household items\n\nMedicines\n\nOther daily-use essentials\n\nOur unique value proposition lies in local presence and quality assurance. We will have our own trained delivery personnel who are not only responsible for timely delivery but also for checking the quality of goods before dispatch. This ensures customer satisfaction and trust, especially in perishable items like vegetables and fruits.\n\nWe plan to purchase goods in bulk directly from suppliers or markets, allowing us to offer products at competitive prices. The cost advantage will also come from cutting out middlemen and negotiating shopkeeper discounts. Revenue will be generated primarily through service charges on each order.\n\nBy starting in my native location and understanding the local needs, Digital Chhattisgarh is positioned to become a trusted name in rural and semi-urban delivery services, before expanding to other parts of the state.",
    "problemSolved": "Problems: \n\nLack of Online Shopping Services in Remote Areas:\n\nTowns like Kirandul, Bacheli, and Dantewada do not have access to e-commerce platforms or reliable delivery services.\n\nLimited Availability of Quality Products Locally:\n\nCustomers are often forced to buy low-quality or overpriced items due to lack of options and proper quality checks.\n\nNo Doorstep Delivery:\n\nSenior citizens, working professionals, and remote residents face difficulty in getting daily essentials delivered to their homes.\n\nHigh Prices and No Discounts in Local Markets:\n\nShopkeepers often sell at fixed high prices due to no competition or bulk pricing systems.\n\nUnorganized Local Retail System:\n\nNo structured or convenient way for people to buy essentials through mobile or online platforms in these regions.\n\nSolutions by Digital Chhattisgarh: \n\nLaunch of a Localized E-commerce App:\n\nA user-friendly app that offers online ordering of vegetables, fruits, groceries, medicines, and more for remote towns.\n\nDoor-to-Door Delivery with Trained Staff:\n\nYour own delivery team will ensure timely and safe delivery at customers’ doorsteps—even in remote areas.\n\nBulk Buying to Cut Costs:\n\nBy purchasing in bulk from wholesalers, your business will offer lower prices than local shops and pass savings to customers.\n\nQuality Assurance at Source:\n\nThe delivery staff will personally inspect product quality before dispatching, ensuring high standards and customer satisfaction.\n\nPromotion of Digital Convenience:\n\nEducate and bring rural customers into the digital economy through easy ordering, digital payments, and reliable service.",
    "targetCustomer": "N/A",
    "investedSoFar": "0",
    "investmentNeeded": "10 to 15 lakh",
    "teamMembers": "2",
    "workType": "FULL TIME",
    "businessModel": "Business Model of Digital Chhattisgarh 1. Target Market: \n\nPrimary Areas: Kirandul, Bacheli, Dantewada, and other rural or semi-urban areas of Chhattisgarh.\n\nTarget Customers:\n\nSenior citizens\n\nWorking professionals\n\nStudents\n\nHomemakers\n\nRemote village residents\n\n2. Key Offerings: \n\nVegetables & Fruits\n\nGroceries & Daily Essentials\n\nMedicines\n\nPersonal Care & Household Items\n\nSeasonal & Local Products\n\n3. Value Proposition: \n\nEasy online ordering through a mobile app\n\nAffordable pricing through bulk purchasing\n\nDoorstep delivery even in remote areas\n\nQuality assurance of products before delivery\n\nConvenience of digital payments and cash on delivery\n\n4. Revenue Streams: \n\nProduct Margin: Buying at wholesale rates and selling at competitive prices\n\nDelivery Charges: Small fees for express or long-distance delivery\n\nSubscription Plans: Monthly/weekly delivery packages for regular customers\n\nPromotions & Ads: Local businesses can advertise on the app\n\nPremium Services: Priority delivery, special offers, and loyalty rewards\n\n5. Cost Structure: \n\nApp development & maintenance\n\nStaff salaries (delivery agents, app support)\n\nLogistics (vehicles, fuel, packaging)\n\nWarehousing for bulk storage\n\nMarketing and customer education campaigns\n\n6. Logistics & Operations: \n\nCentralized storage and quality check unit\n\nOwn delivery fleet trained for rural terrains\n\nGPS tracking & delivery optimization\n\nLocal partnerships for product sourcing\n\n7. Customer Acquisition Strategy: \n\nDoor-to-door awareness campaigns\n\nWhatsApp promotions, local newspapers, and posters\n\nReferral incentives and first-time discounts\n\nCommunity tie-ups with SHGs, schools, and panchayats",
    "futureGoals": "N/A",
    "socialLinks": "N/A",
    "businessPlanLink": "https://drive.google.com/open?id=1IeX5STE16RI4np1BTAaFnTmXvtlqfm4u"
